    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "Teams alternate deployment, beginning with the Defender. Put one eligible unit entirely inside its own deployment zone per placement. Units held in strategic reserves stay aside. Setting up a TITANIC unit costs your team’s next placement opportunity. Once one side finishes, its opponent deploys any remaining units due on the battlefield.",
